      "content": "it's hard not to feel that way. i just look at my life and it feels like i'm constantly fighting against this massive, inevitable tide. like i'm just struggling to maintain some kind of order and meaning in a world that is fundamentally designed to dissolve. it feels so illogical to keep putting in all this effort when the physics of it all say that even the biggest stars eventually just run out. it feels like i'm just fighting a losing battle for no reason.",
